Subject: [PATCH] EDEN_UP_LIVE_SWITCHES: seven switches can change while the game runs, from a control file the app reads twice a second (a schedule of phases it steps through itself, logging each phase's frames), so one start compares a switch on and off at one spot; off by default (v2 after review: phases of 1 s at least, no frame wait off without the load wait, nothing that only reports can throw)

diff --git a/src/common/live_switch.h b/src/common/live_switch.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..96d2fab
--- /dev/null
